id: DRAFT-rapidyaml-0.7.2-c4core-cmake-submodule-vendoring
severity: 2
category: build-system|cmake|conan|source
trigger_tool: cmake|conan
phase: configuration|package
approach: export-sources-submodule-vendoring
keywords: c4core, submodule, release tarball, c4Project.cmake, export_sources, vendoring, HarmonyOS, OHOS
error_signature: include could not find requested file: ./ext/c4core/cmake/c4Project.cmake|unknown platform. CMAKE_SYSTEM_NAME=HarmonyOS
match_keywords: c4core,submodule,release tarball,cmake,c4Project.cmake,empty directory,debugbreak
title: c4core 系 CMake 辅助子模块在官方 tarball 中缺失（cmake/ 与 debugbreak/），需 export_sources 打包恢复
root_cause: "GitHub source tarball 不含 git 子模块内容，只留空目录。rapidyaml 0.7.2 依赖 c4core v0.2.2
  （ext/c4core 为子模块），而 c4core 的 cmake/（biojppm/cmake）、src/c4/ext/debugbreak/、
  src/c4/ext/fast_float/ 又各是子模块：rapidyaml CMakeLists 第 2 行就 include
  ./ext/c4core/cmake/c4Project.cmake，tarball 解压后该文件不存在 → configure 失败。"
affected_scope: "上游依赖 c4core 或 biojppm/cmake 辅助模块的 CMake 项目（rapidyaml、c4fs 等）；
  任何其构建辅助模块以 git 子模块形式存在、而官方 tarball 不含子模块内容的库"
verification_cmd: "tar tzf <c4core-v0.2.2.tar.gz> | grep 'cmake/' ; ls ext/c4core/cmake/ 2>/dev/null"
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: "conan 配方 export_sources 打包子模块内容，build() 恢复后再 configure"
rec_description: "将 c4core 的 cmake/ 子模块 22 个 .cmake 模块与 debugbreak.h 放入配方 patches/ 目录，
  export_sources() 导出，build() 中复制回 ext/c4core/cmake/ 与 src/c4/ext/debugbreak/，然后
  apply_conandata_patches（HarmonyOS 平台分支 + CMP0037 守卫）后 cmake configure。与 c4core/0.6.0
  归档处理其自身子模块的模式一致。禁止在配方里 git submodule update（tarball 非 git 仓库，不可复现）。"
rec_command: "conan create archives/r/rapidyaml/0.7.2 -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 --build=missing"
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual-edit
forbid_1_pattern: git submodule update
forbid_1_reason: 源码 tarball 不是 git 仓库，submodule update 必然失败且不可复现
forbid_1_consequence: fatal: not a git repository；CI 干净环境无法复现本地
forbid_2_pattern: file://|\.build-cache|predl_cache
forbid_2_reason: 配方不得引用本地路径或缓存（R39/PF7 源 URL 闸）
forbid_2_consequence: CI 构建失败或审计拦截
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: recursive-clone-verify
fallback_description: 备选：git clone --recursive 完整获取子模块后手工编译验证（仅探索期）；
  正式配方仍须以官方 tarball + export_sources 打包恢复为准
fallback_command: "git clone --recursive --depth 1 --branch v0.2.2 https://github.com/biojppm/c4core ext/c4core"
fallback_auto_fix: false
principles: P003, P011
similar_to: E150, DRAFT-release-tarball-missing-cmake-submodule
caused_by:
prerequisite_of: DRAFT-rapidyaml-0.7.2-cmake4-cmp0037-old-guard
conflicts_with:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-rapidyaml-0.7.2-c4core-cmake-submodule-vendoring.md
last_updated: 2026-09-06
source_event: "rapidyaml 0.7.2 适配 HarmonyOS PC：ext/c4core 为空导致 include c4Project.cmake 失败；
  export_sources 恢复后 conan create 全门禁通过（G2 PASS、W3 100%）"
authors:
source_pr:
source_commit: 1f83cb45d9
metrics_success_count: 0
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 0.0
